{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、自動販売機でお菓子を１つ\n買ったら、２つ出てきました(｡･д･｡) 幸運っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今日、すごく\nこわい夢をみました（ ;  ; ）うりゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良いことのあとには、\n必ず悪いことがあるのですね神様(′;ω;｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、悪いことのあとには\nきっと必ず良いことがある！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、明日のイベントは\nすごく良いものになるってこと、\nわたしは確信しているよっ(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで楽しみましょうね  ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、質問返しの続きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼乃木坂のオジキャラって誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー誰だろー(´･ω･`) ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"敷いていえば、ゆったんかなあ(^_^;)\nおしりをさわってくるから(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼握手会の時何話せば良い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介してくださいっ(o^^o)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと皆さんのこと知りたいし、\n仲良くなりたいので  **"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼甘い物好きと聞いていますが、\n具体的に一番食べたい甘い物を\n宜しければ上から三つ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１ いちご\n２  ホットケーキ\n３  チョコレート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですっ (*`･ω･*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼時々左利きって、どんなとき？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"球技とか、自転車の運転とか…ですっ(*`･ω･*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼俺もなんか質問してもいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非っ (* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼何を目標に芸能界に入ったんですか？\nあの日テレジェニックの時からで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人並みの幸せに別れを告げ\n平和を守るために…      ウソです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼尊敬する(好きな)女優は何方ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新垣結衣さんですかね(*´･ω･*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼一番好きな季節は夏ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ (* ^o^ *)♪\n寒いの苦手なんです；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼さゆにゃんにとって今年(去年)は\nどんな年だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一言でいうと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶうわぁっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼来年(今年)の抱負とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に厳しく。です(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、何かの占いでいて座は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"